  "description": "The life of a celebrity is far from a bed of roses. Choi Deokhee, better known as Deok-E, knows that better than anyone else. Everything he’s worked so hard to accomplish comes crashing down in a single night when he runs over a sasaeng fan who had abruptly dashed in front of his car. But by some stroke of luck, a mysterious man, Jung Yool, witnesses the entire incident and helps Deokhee cover it up. However, something imperceptibly sinister seems to be lying beneath Jung Yool’s helpful facade… \n\n(Source: Tapas)",
